# Pinned 2026-08-03 (ICE forward-port to upstream HEAD 81d9961 / v1.0.0.1).
#
# Upstream ICE consumes ECommons and Pictomancy as NuGet packages and OtterGui /
# Glamourer.Api as git submodules. All four are net10 / Dalamud.NET.Sdk 14-15 upstream, so
# the TC tree vendors hand-retargeted api13 source for each. A refresh must NOT overwrite
# them from upstream -- there is nothing upstream to overwrite them WITH, and `git archive`
# does not descend into submodule gitlinks (it would leave OtterGui/ and Glamourer.Api/
# empty). See doc/FORWARD_PORT_REFERENCE.md.
ECommons/*
ffxiv_pictomancy/*
OtterGui/*
Glamourer.Api/*

# TC-only compatibility layer that has no upstream counterpart: without the pin a refresh's
# wipe deletes it and the tree stops compiling.
ICE/Compat/*

# NOT version-pinned. ICE tracks upstream's <Version>.
